# Generated artefacts. Everything here is rebuilt from the seed with the four commands
# in README.md, so the repository holds no binaries and no multi-megabyte data files.
#
# `ground-truth.jsonl` is 4,999,001 bytes and `sample/ground-truth.jsonl` is 244,734.
# Both are rebuilt by `python3 generate.py --seed 20260902`; their SHA-256s are in the
# repository's `REGENERATED.md` and in `sample/README.md`, so a rebuild is checked
# rather than trusted. A two-document `sample/preview.jsonl` is committed instead, so
# the shape of an item can be read here without running anything.
build/
documents/
sample/documents/
ground-truth.jsonl
sample/ground-truth.jsonl
__pycache__/
*.pyc
